or","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 25% of normal in February to March and 34% of normal in November to December. Grid 19327 had its driest year in 1956 at 42% of normal.</p>"}
